# Frontend design schema

Canonical tokens live in `apps/web/src/index.css` under `:root`. Treat that file as the **single source of truth** for surfaces, typography, radius, and default shadows. Values follow the SpaceXSI / x.ai design system.

## Tokens (reference)

| Token | Role |
|-------|------|
| `--bg`, `--card`, `--card-border` | Page, elevated surface, separation (borders, not shadows) |
| `--fg`, `--fg-strong`, `--fg-muted` | Body text, headings/selected, small secondary text (`#5f6368` / `#9a9ea5`) |
| `--fg-subtle` | Fog `#7d8187` — add only if an icon or ≥18px label needs it. Do not add `--muted-fg`. |
| `--accent`, `--accent-hover` | Sunset / dawn — small highlights only (not light-mode text) |
| `--accent-fg` | Reserved; do not place sunset behind text in light mode |
| `--focus` | 2px outline, 2px offset (`#0a0a0a` / `#ffffff`) |
| `--up`, `--down` | Market gains / losses |
| `--info` | Breeze — split markers in dark |
| `--event-div`, `--event-split` | Dividend (`#b84300` / `#ff6308`); split stroke (`--fg-strong` light, `--info` dark) |
| `--shadow`, `--shadow-sm` | Always `none` — separate surfaces with borders |
| `--grid` | Chart gridlines (`#d5d9e2` / `#2e3033`), dashed |
| `--radius`, `--radius-pill` | 0.5rem cards/dropdowns; 9999px buttons, segments, chips |
| `--font`, `--font-mono` | `Geist Variable` / Arial; `Geist Mono Variable` / ui-monospace + tabular nums |

## Rules

1. **Prefer CSS variables** for layout chrome. Avoid new hard-coded hex/rgb except meaning-specific hues until those become named tokens.
2. **Add new primitives in `:root` first**, then wire `var(--…)`.
3. **Focus**: `:focus-visible` is `2px solid var(--focus)` with `2px` offset.
4. **Contrast**: small muted text is `--fg-muted` (`#5f6368` / `#9a9ea5`). Fog `#7d8187` is only for icons and text ≥18px (`--fg-subtle` if that needs a token). Sunset is never used for text in light mode. Focus is `2px solid var(--focus)` with a `2px` offset (`#0a0a0a` / `#ffffff`), never `--accent`.
5. **Type**: load `@fontsource-variable/geist` and `@fontsource-variable/geist-mono` (`font-display: swap`). Weights 400 and 500, plus 600 for the price heading. Controls 13px. Geist Mono + `tabular-nums` on prices, axes, tickers.
6. **Chart**: price line `--fg-strong` (never sunset) with a `--fg-strong` fill at ~6% fading to 0. Gridlines `--grid` (dashed); axis text `--fg-muted` in Geist Mono. Sunset is only for events.
7. **Motion**: color/theme transitions only under `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference)`.
8. **Disabled buttons**: transparent background, 1px `--card-border`, `--fg-muted` text, `cursor: not-allowed`. Enabled primary pills are `--fg-strong` fill / `--bg` text.

### Example

```css
.panel {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  color: var(--fg);
}
```

Dark values live on `html.dark`. With no saved choice, `@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)` on `html:not(.light)` applies the same names. The blocking script in `apps/web/index.html` adds `.dark` or `.light` before paint when the user has an explicit preference. Do not branch colors inside components.
